        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86921, Modern Rosette for Cabinet Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Cabinet Backplate for Knobs is the perfect finishing touch. From kitchen cabinets to furniture pieces, this cabinet knob rosette will add that extra detail that really makes a space pop. The Modern Rosette for Cabinet Knobs 4 inches x 1 inch and will work with many <a href=\"/collections/emtek-cabinet-hardware\">Emtek Cabinet Knobs</a>. The Modern Cabinet Backplates is available in all the contemporary finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86921-installed.jpg?v=1704354577\" width=\"337\" height=\"222\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 86921 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Cabinet Knob Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Package includes (1) backplate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86921-speicifcations.pdf?v=1704262425\"><b>Emtek Modern Cabinet Backplate for Knobs Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
